      "title": "Purify Antibodies by Protein G",
      "instruction": "Harvest the culture supernatant and purify monoclonal antibodies using HiTrap Protein G columns (GE Healthcare Bio‑Sciences AB, Uppsala, Sweden) following the column’s affinity‑chromatography protocol.",
